  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Industrial Park Green and Low-Carbon Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project, a financial intermediation loan (FIL), will support the PRC in achieving its commitment to combating climate change by catalyzing financing and strengthening institutional capacity for the low-carbon transition in carbon-intensive sectors. The project will leverage domestic commercial cofinancing to upscale low-carbon transition investments and foster private-sector-led solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
